"attributes": [{"id": 1, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "Eerste wijzigingsverordening belastingen 2016"}, {"id": 3, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "<p>1. Het college stelt de raad voor de Eerste wijzigingsverordening belastingen 2016 vast te stellen.2. Het besluit heeft slechts geringe financi&euml;le consequenties.3. Communicatie: de verordening wordt bekendgemaakt in het Gemeenteblad en treedt de dag na publicatie in werking. De aanpassingen worden verwerkt in de op Overheid.nl gepubliceerde Verordening leges 2016 en Verordening reclame binnenstad 2016.4. Het college stuurt dit voorstel naar de gemeenteraad, nadat de commissie Bestuur hierover een advies heeft uitgebracht.</p>"}]}, "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 7533764, "type": "agenda_point", "order": 2, "start_offset": null, "end_offset": null, "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "confidential": 0, "permission_group": "public", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:11:32", "documents": [{"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616631", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616631/1", "title": "1. Raadsinformatieformulier", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616631, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-12 13:44:11", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "1_ Raadsinformatieformulier.pdf", "file_size": 440992, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616631/1/connections/1/7533764", "version": 1, "order": 1, "document_id": 12616631, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533764}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616632", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616632/2", "title": "2. Raadsstuk: Eerste wijzigingsverordening belastingen 2016", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616632, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:11:27", "version": 2, "types": [{"id": 452, "value": "Raadsstuk"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "2_ Raadsstuk_ Eerste wijzigingsverordening belastingen 2016.pdf", "file_size": 388918, "id": 2}, {"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "2_ Raadsstuk_ Eerste wijzigingsverordening belastingen 2016.pdf", "file_size": 388918, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616632/2/connections/1/7533764", "version": 2, "order": 2, "document_id": 12616632, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533764}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616633", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616633/2", "title": "3. Bijlage 1: Overzicht wijzigingen", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616633, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:11:32", "version": 2, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "3_ Bijlage 1_ Overzicht wijzigingen.pdf", "file_size": 660982, "id": 2}, {"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "3_ Bijlage 1_ Overzicht wijzigingen.pdf", "file_size": 660982, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616633/2/connections/1/7533764", "version": 2, "order": 4, "document_id": 12616633, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533764}]}]}, {"parent": null, "meeting": {"id": 1102347, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/events/meetings/1102347"}, "type_data": {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/agenda_items/agenda_points/7533770", "heading": false, "title_prefix": "3.", "attributes": [{"id": 1, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "Motie 14 - Professionele lobby voor investeringen in de stad"}, {"id": 3, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "<p>1. Het college neemt de in de bijlage opgenomen visie over het voeren van een effectieve lobby als uitgangspunt voor de inzet op toekomstige lobbyactiviteiten. 2. Het college stuurt de nota ter informatie naar de Commissie Bestuur.3. Het besluit heeft op dit moment geen financi&euml;le consequenties. Indien wordt besloten tot het intensiveren van de lobby voor investeringen in de stad, op het gebied van regionale samenwerking (MRA en G32) of naar aanleiding van de uitkomst van de Toekomstvisie, zullen extra middelen benodigd zijn.</p>"}]}, "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 7533770, "type": "agenda_point", "order": 3, "start_offset": null, "end_offset": null, "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "confidential": 0, "permission_group": "public", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:11:47", "documents": [{"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616637", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616637/1", "title": "1. Raadsinformatieformulier", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616637, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-12 13:44:48", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "1_ Raadsinformatieformulier.pdf", "file_size": 444737, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616637/1/connections/1/7533770", "version": 1, "order": 1, "document_id": 12616637, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533770}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616638", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616638/2", "title": "2. Collegebesluit: Motie 14 - Professionele lobby voor investeringen in de stad", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616638, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:11:41", "version": 2, "types": [{"id": 7, "value": "Motie"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime