 voor:&middot; Het bestemmingsplan IJsbaan met identificatienummer NL.IMRO.0392.BP6120007-va01 gewijzigd vast te stellen;&middot; Geen exploitatieplan vast te stellen.&middot; Het besluit heeft verder geen financi&euml;le consequenties;&middot; De betrokkenen ontvangen na besluitvorming informatie over dit besluit;&middot; Het college stuurt dit voorstel naar de gemeenteraad, nadat de commissie Ontwikkeling hierover een advies heeft uitgebracht.</p>"}]}, "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 7533784, "type": "agenda_point", "order": 8, "start_offset": null, "end_offset": null, "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "confidential": 0, "permission_group": "public", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:12:53", "documents": [{"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616818", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616818/1", "title": "1. Raadsinformatieformulier", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616818, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-12 14:04:52", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "1_ Raadsinformatieformulier.pdf", "file_size": 382128, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616818/1/connections/1/7533784", "version": 1, "order": 1, "document_id": 12616818, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533784}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616820", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616820/2", "title": "2. Raadsstuk: Vaststelling bestemmingsplan IJsbaan", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616820, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:12:40", "version": 2, "types": [{"id": 452, "value": "Raadsstuk"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "2_ Raadsstuk_ Vaststelling bestemmingsplan IJsbaan.p