ence_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "Uitwerkingsplan Informatienota 'Gemeentelijke communicatie: voor en met de stad'"}, {"id": 3, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "<p>1. In te stemmen met het voorgestelde uitwerkingsplan Communicatieonderzoek 20152. het Communicatieonderzoek over twee jaar (begin 2018) te herhalen om te zien of het uitgevoerde actieplan effect heeft gehad. 3. Dekking is begroot op beleidsveld communicatie en dienstverlening; 4. Stuurt het voorgestelde uitwerkingsplan ter informatie naar de commissie bestuur</p>"}]}, "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 7533790, "type": "agenda_point", "order": 11, "start_offset": null, "end_offset": null, "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "confidential": 0, "permission_group": "public", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:13:27", "documents": [{"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616925", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616925/1", "title": "1. Raadsinformatieformulier", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616925, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-12 14:07:46", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "1_ Raadsinformatieformulier.pdf", "file_size": 438329, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616925/1/connections/1/7533790", "version": 1, "order": 1, "document_id": 12616925, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533790}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616927", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616927/2", "title": "2. Collegebesluit: Uitwerkingsplan Informatienota 'Gemeentelijke communicatie  voor en met de stad'", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616927, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:13:27", "version": 2, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "2_ Collegebesluit_Uitwerkingsplan Informatienota 'Gemeentelijke communicatie_ voor en met de stad'.pdf", "file_size": 584268, "id": 2}, {"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "2_ Collegebesluit_Uitwerkingsplan Informatienota 'Gemeentelijke communicatie_ voor en met de stad'.pdf", "file_size": 584268, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616927/2/connections/1/7533790", "version": 2, "order": 2, "document_id": 12616927, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533790}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616926", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616926/1", "title": "3. Bijlage 1 Uitwerkingsplan", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616926, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-12 14:07:45", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "3_ Bijlage 1 Uitwerkingsplan.pdf", "file_size": 415939, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616926/1/connections/1/7533790", "version": 1, "order": 3, "document_id": 12616926, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533790}]}]}, {"parent": null, "meeting": {"id": 1102347, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/events/meetings/1102347"}, "type_data": {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/agenda_items/agenda_points/7533791", "heading": false, "title_prefix": "12.", "attributes": [{"id": 1, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "DSK: Definitief Ontwerp openbare ruimte"}, {"id": 3, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "<p>1) Het college stelt de notitie met de beoordeling van de ingediende bezwaren (bijlage 1) vast. 2) Het college stelt het Definitief Ontwerp \"DSK 3\" (bijlage 2) vast. 3) Het college besluit de openbare ruimte Anna Kaulbachstraat als onderdeel van de ontwikkeling van DSK 3 als areaaluitbreiding in beheer te nemen en de kosten - overeenkomstig punt 4.6 van de nota -op basis van revisie mee te nemen in de Kadernota 2016 - 2020 ten laste van de algemene middelen 4) Het besluit genoemd onder punt 2 wordt inclusief de vastgestelde notitie genoemd onder punt 1ter informatie aan de betrokkenen gestuurd.5) Het college stuurt dit besluit ter kennisname aan de commissie Ontwikkeling en Beheer</p>"}]}, "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 7533791, "type": "agenda_point", "order": 12, "start_offset": null, "end_offset": null, "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "confidential": 0, "permission_group": "public", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:13:51", "documents": [{"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616944", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616944/1", "title": "1. Raadsinformatieformulier", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616944, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-12 14:08:42", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "1_ Raadsinformatieformulier.pdf", "file_size": 443068, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616944/1/connections/1/7533791", "version": 1, "order": 1, "document_id": 12616944, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 7533791}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/12616946", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/12616946/2", "title": "2. Collegebesluit  DSK 3: Definitief Ontwerp openbare ruimte", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 12616946, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2023-04-21 15:13:39", "version": 2, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "2_ Collegebesluit_ DSK 3_ Definitief On